<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 108 0 R
/E (Immediate remediation of the identified vulnerabilities is essential to prevent real-world exploitation. By addressing these issues and adopting recommended security best practices, the organization can significantly improve its security posture and reduce the likelihood of future attacks.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [4]
>>
